#ASSERT (`citation: section 26(a) names section 7`)'s `Amendment 19 replaced the citing words`
#ASSERT NOT (`both limbs hold` (`reference: I1 control, section 26(a) to section 7`))

#ASSERT `the citation names the section as printed` (`citation: section 30(1) names section 7`) (`section 7 as item 1 of Amendment 19 prints it`)
